10-013-330-02:3","fields":{"action":["action.add"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.indigenous"],"condition":[],"funding":["funding.government-budget"],"instrument":["instrument.cash-benefit"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.central-government"],"target":["target.land-restriction-compensation"]},"id":"10-013-330-02-3-005","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-330-02-3-p1","quote":"爭取國軍睦鄰經費，實質補償受限鄉民","reason":"主張爭取國軍的睦鄰經費，補償受管制影響的鄉民；牡丹鄉是原住民族地區，公務機關管制原鄉土地的補償依詞表的區分配土地受限補償；睦鄰經費由國防部編列，主體寫中央政府，財源寫政府預算","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":127},{"end":31,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-013-330-02:4","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.tourism"]},"id":"10-013-330-02-4-001","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-330-02-4-p1","quote":"致力推動牡丹鄉各村莊觀光產業發展","reason":"主張推動牡丹鄉各村的觀光；第一、三項是問政態度與概括語，不建立主張；原文沒有寫出做法","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":15},{"end":101,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-013-330-02:4","fields":{"action":["action.improve"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.public-provision"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.tribal-infrastructure","target.farm-production-facilities"]},"id":"10-013-330-02-4-002","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-013-330-02-4-p1","quote":"爭取經費建設地方基礎建設、巷道、農路、排水設施、部落環境、路燈、擋土牆等等","reason":"主張爭取經費建設巷道、農路、排水、路燈與擋土牆等設施；巷道、排水、路燈與擋土牆依既有寫法合為部落基礎建設，農路配農業生產設施，兩個面向各半","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":64},{"end":113,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-013-330-02:4","fields":{"action":["action.add"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.indigenous"],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.public-provision"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-govern